{"id": 6467, "date": "2026-07-11T07:06:00", "date_gmt": "2026-07-11T07:06:00", "guid": {"rendered": "https://artibits.com/?p=6467", "raw": "https://artibits.com/?p=6467"}, "modified": "2026-09-17T14:05:39", "modified_gmt": "2026-09-17T14:05:39", "password": "", "slug": "loonar-in-the-valve-manufacturing-sector-europe", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://artibits.com/2026/07/11/loonar-in-the-valve-manufacturing-sector-europe/", "title": {"raw": "Loonar in the Valve Manufacturing Sector (Europe)\u00a0", "rendered": "Loonar in the Valve Manufacturing Sector (Europe)\u00a0"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>HOW A EUROPEAN VALVE MANUFACTURER ACCELERATED RFQ MANAGEMENT WITH LOONAR AI AGENTS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">A European industrial valve manufacturer transformed its manual RFQ process with Loonar accelerating quote preparation, strengthening compliance reviews, reducing commercial risk, and freeing skilled teams to focus on growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>RESULTS AT A GLANCE</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>30%</strong> - Faster quote preparation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>\u20ac130K</strong> - Annual labour savings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>1.8 FTEs</strong> - Released for higher-value activities</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>PROJECT OVERVIEW</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Industrial Valve Manufacturing - Oil and Gas and Infrastructure</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Region:</strong> Europe</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Loonar AI Agents for RFQ Management</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Processes:</strong> RFQ Analysis, Bid/No-Bid Decisions, Technical Reviews, Commercial Reviews, and Proposal Preparation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Users:</strong> Engineering, Sales, and Commercial Teams</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>THE CHALLENGE</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">High-volume bidding periods placed significant pressure on the manufacturer\u2019s engineering and commercial teams.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">RFQs contained hundreds of pages of technical specifications, datasheets, contractual terms, and commercial requirements that had to be reviewed manually.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong><br>Key challenges included:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Slow RFQ turnaround times</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Engineers spending excessive time on repetitive administrative work</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Manual extraction of technical requirements</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Technical and commercial review errors</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Heavy dependence on key personnel</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Bottlenecks in bid reviews and approvals</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Risk provisions exceeding \u20ac100,000 per project</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Limited visibility into RFQ progress and risk exposure</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>BEFORE LOONAR</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">RFQ Received \u2192 Manual Document Review \u2192 Key-Person Assessment \u2192 Repetitive Compliance Checks \u2192 Delayed Quotation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">This labour-intensive process slowed responses, increased commercial risk, and reduced the time available for customer engagement and business development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>THE SOLUTION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Loonar AI Agents digitalized and standardized the manufacturer\u2019s RFQ and quotation processes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The solution included:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Automated RFQ document analysis</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Specification extraction from datasheets and tender documents</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Structured bid/no-bid assessments</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Technical deviation identification</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Clause-by-clause terms and conditions review</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Early identification of legal and commercial risks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Reusable proposal and content library</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Access to previous datasheets and supplier offers</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Real-time RFQ, compliance, and risk dashboards</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>HOW LOONAR WORKS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Upload \u2192 Extract \u2192 Analyse \u2192 Validate \u2192 Review \u2192 Respond \u2192 Track</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Teams upload RFQ documents to Loonar. AI agents extract the relevant technical and commercial requirements, identify deviations and risks, retrieve reusable content, and organize the information for expert review and response preparation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual document review</td>\n            <td>AI-assisted information extraction</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repetitive compliance checks</td>\n            <td>Automated validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Key-person dependency</td>\n            <td>Standardized review workflows</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Scattered proposal content</td>\n            <td>Centralized content library</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Late risk identification</td>\n            <td>Early deviation and risk detection</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited RFQ visibility</td>\n            <td>Real-time dashboards</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>6.5-day quote cycle</td>\n            <td>4.5-day quote cycle</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>MEASURABLE RESULTS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">30% FASTER QUOTE PREPARATION</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The average quote cycle decreased from 6.5 days to 4.5 days, enabling faster customer responses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u20ac130,000 IN ANNUAL LABOUR SAVINGS</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Automating repetitive RFQ activities generated approximately \u20ac130,000 in annual labour savings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">1.8 FTEs RELEASED FOR HIGHER-VALUE WORK</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The solution freed capacity equivalent to 1.8 full-time employees for customer engagement and growth-focused activities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u20ac100,000+ RISK PROVISIONS ELIMINATED</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Automated validation and earlier risk identification removed the need for risk provisions exceeding \u20ac100,000 per project.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Additional improvements included:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 More consistent technical and commercial reviews</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Reduced manual compliance errors</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Faster bid/no-bid decisions</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Less dependence on individual key personnel</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Improved reuse of proposal and supplier information</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Greater visibility into RFQ progress and risk exposure</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Increased commercial capacity during high-volume bidding periods</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>KEY TAKEAWAY</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Loonar transformed a slow, manual RFQ process into a connected, AI-powered workflow helping the manufacturer quote faster, reduce commercial risk, and redirect skilled resources toward business growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-125 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HOW A EUROPEAN VALVE MANUFACTURER ACCELERATED RFQ MANAGEMENT WITH LOONAR AI AGENTS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-126 wp-block-paragraph\">A European industrial valve manufacturer transformed its manual RFQ process with Loonar accelerating quote preparation, strengthening compliance reviews, reducing commercial risk, and freeing skilled teams to focus on growth.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-127 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>RESULTS AT A GLANCE</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-128 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>30%</strong> &#8211; Faster quote preparation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-129 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>\u20ac130K</strong> &#8211; Annual labour savings</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-130 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>1.8 FTEs</strong> &#8211; Released for higher-value activities</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-131 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>PROJECT OVERVIEW</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-132 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Industrial Valve Manufacturing &#8211; Oil and Gas and Infrastructure</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-133 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Region:</strong> Europe</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-134 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Loonar AI Agents for RFQ Management</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-135 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Processes:</strong> RFQ Analysis, Bid/No-Bid Decisions, Technical Reviews, Commercial Reviews, and Proposal Preparation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-136 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Users:</strong> Engineering, Sales, and Commercial Teams</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-137 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>THE CHALLENGE</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-138 wp-block-paragraph\">High-volume bidding periods placed significant pressure on the manufacturer\u2019s engineering and commercial teams.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-139 wp-block-paragraph\">RFQs contained hundreds of pages of technical specifications, datasheets, contractual terms, and commercial requirements that had to be reviewed manually.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-140 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><br>Key challenges included:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-141 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Slow RFQ turnaround times</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-142 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Engineers spending excessive time on repetitive administrative work</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-143 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Manual extraction of technical requirements</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-144 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Technical and commercial review errors</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-145 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Heavy dependence on key personnel</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-146 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Bottlenecks in bid reviews and approvals</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-147 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Risk provisions exceeding \u20ac100,000 per project</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-148 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Limited visibility into RFQ progress and risk exposure</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-149 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>BEFORE LOONAR</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-150 wp-block-paragraph\">RFQ Received \u2192 Manual Document Review \u2192 Key-Person Assessment \u2192 Repetitive Compliance Checks \u2192 Delayed Quotation</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-151 wp-block-paragraph\">This labour-intensive process slowed responses, increased commercial risk, and reduced the time available for customer engagement and business development.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-152 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>THE SOLUTION</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-153 wp-block-paragraph\">Loonar AI Agents digitalized and standardized the manufacturer\u2019s RFQ and quotation processes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-154 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The solution included:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-155 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Automated RFQ document analysis</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-156 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Specification extraction from datasheets and tender documents</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-157 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Structured bid/no-bid assessments</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-158 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Technical deviation identification</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-159 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Clause-by-clause terms and conditions review</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-160 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Early identification of legal and commercial risks</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-161 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Reusable proposal and content library</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-162 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Access to previous datasheets and supplier offers</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-163 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Real-time RFQ, compliance, and risk dashboards</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-164 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HOW LOONAR WORKS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-165 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Upload \u2192 Extract \u2192 Analyse \u2192 Validate \u2192 Review \u2192 Respond \u2192 Track</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-166 wp-block-paragraph\">Teams upload RFQ documents to Loonar. AI agents extract the relevant technical and commercial requirements, identify deviations and risks, retrieve reusable content, and organize the information for expert review and response preparation.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual document review</td>\n            <td>AI-assisted information extraction</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repetitive compliance checks</td>\n            <td>Automated validation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Key-person dependency</td>\n            <td>Standardized review workflows</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Scattered proposal content</td>\n            <td>Centralized content library</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Late risk identification</td>\n            <td>Early deviation and risk detection</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited RFQ visibility</td>\n            <td>Real-time dashboards</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>6.5-day quote cycle</td>\n            <td>4.5-day quote cycle</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-167 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>MEASURABLE RESULTS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-168 wp-block-paragraph\">30% FASTER QUOTE PREPARATION</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-169 wp-block-paragraph\">The average quote cycle decreased from 6.5 days to 4.5 days, enabling faster customer responses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-170 wp-block-paragraph\">\u20ac130,000 IN ANNUAL LABOUR SAVINGS</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-171 wp-block-paragraph\">Automating repetitive RFQ activities generated approximately \u20ac130,000 in annual labour savings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-172 wp-block-paragraph\">1.8 FTEs RELEASED FOR HIGHER-VALUE WORK</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-173 wp-block-paragraph\">The solution freed capacity equivalent to 1.8 full-time employees for customer engagement and growth-focused activities.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-174 wp-block-paragraph\">\u20ac100,000+ RISK PROVISIONS ELIMINATED</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-175 wp-block-paragraph\">Automated validation and earlier risk identification removed the need for risk provisions exceeding \u20ac100,000 per project.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-176 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Additional improvements included:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-177 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 More consistent technical and commercial reviews</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-178 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Reduced manual compliance errors</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-179 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Faster bid/no-bid decisions</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-180 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Less dependence on individual key personnel</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-181 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Improved reuse of proposal and supplier information</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-182 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Greater visibility into RFQ progress and risk exposure</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-183 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Increased commercial capacity during high-volume bidding periods</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-184 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>KEY TAKEAWAY</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-185 wp-block-paragraph\">Loonar transformed a slow, manual RFQ process into a connected, AI-powered workflow helping the manufacturer quote faster, reduce commercial risk, and redirect skilled resources toward business growth.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-186 wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>HOW A EUROPEAN VALVE MANUFACTURER ACCELERATED RFQ MANAGEMENT WITH LOONAR AI AGENTS A European industrial valve manufacturer transf